1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,510
Keep user input, even when saving fails.

2
00:00:03,670 --> 00:00:07,934
How can a real repair leave experience backed by evidence?

3
00:00:08,814 --> 00:00:12,638
The user fills in customer details and clicks Save.

4
00:00:12,798 --> 00:00:17,228
The service fails, and all the input disappears.

5
00:00:20,714 --> 00:00:24,640
The explicit correction: preserve every input on failure.

6
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:29,244
Clear the form only after saving succeeds.

7
00:00:30,124 --> 00:00:34,181
The cause: the draft is cleared before the save.

8
00:00:34,341 --> 00:00:38,883
Move that operation until after success is confirmed.

9
00:00:41,524 --> 00:00:44,121
Simulate the same failure again.

10
00:00:44,281 --> 00:00:49,510
The name, phone, and note remain intact for a manual retry.

11
00:00:53,724 --> 00:00:56,645
Restore the service and double-click Save.

12
00:00:56,805 --> 00:01:01,639
Only one request is added. The form clears after success.

13
00:01:02,519 --> 00:01:07,604
The real verifier replays the original and fixed versions.

14
00:01:07,764 --> 00:01:12,814
Both original acceptance checks fail; both fixed checks pass.

15
00:01:12,974 --> 00:01:17,030
All three regression tests also pass.

16
00:01:17,910 --> 00:01:21,213
Open the real plugin's standalone workbench.

17
00:01:21,373 --> 00:01:25,704
This repair has left one source-verified experience.

18
00:01:26,584 --> 00:01:31,242
Find the original problem and explicit correction in the library.

19
00:01:33,084 --> 00:01:36,997
Open the details to review the reminder from this repair.

20
00:01:37,157 --> 00:01:41,690
The source repair passed. Later tasks still need their own checks.

21
00:01:42,570 --> 00:01:48,104
Expand the evidence to inspect original, fixed, and regression results.

22
00:01:48,264 --> 00:01:52,228
This experience has not yet been offered to a later task.

23
00:01:53,108 --> 00:01:56,985
This video shows a first repair with local explicit recording.

24
00:01:57,145 --> 00:02:01,798
No paid model calls were made. Future benefit was not evaluated.
